            <title>[IGNITE-4813] Ignite map-reduce engine should set MRJobConfig.TASK_ATTEMPT_ID</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4813</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Hadoop &quot;join&quot; example fails on Ignite with the error like this:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
