[14:27:29,638][INFO ][&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;Thread&lt;/span&gt;-3][jvm-a6fc1c46] PID-31907  Out: 	at org.apache.ignite.internal.processors.hadoop.impl.v2.HadoopV2MapTask.run0(HadoopV2MapTask.java:69)
