&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This is because org.apache.ignite.internal.processors.hadoop.impl.v2.HadoopV2Context sets the job id and task id, but does not set task attempt id. In Hadoop this is done in method org.apache.hadoop.mapred.Task#localizeConfiguration .&lt;/p&gt;</description>
